I've left out the `http-client` enrichment call. It would send every customer question to an external host on every invocation, and the graph definition doesn't grant that capability yet. The approval can't be verified from inside this task, and a silent outbound call that leaves the output unchanged is the kind of change that needs the graph and its review updated first. The node below uses only the declared `inference-llm` import.

